Please verify and approve the REC Approval request for {!$Record.EYI_REC_Full_Name__c}
Note:
Navigate to the Approval History Tab and click on the Approve/Reject button

Dear Team,
The CP account creation request for {!$Record.Name} (CP ID: {!$Record.EYI_REC_Code__c}) has been rejected by {!$Record.Sourcing_Head__r.LastName}. 

Details:
•	Channel Partner Name: {!$Record.Name}
•	CP ID: {!$Record.EYI_REC_Code__c}
•	Rejection Date: {!$Record.EYI_Request_Received_Date__c}
•	Rejected By: {!$Record.Sourcing_Head__r.LastName}
•	Reason (if provided): N/A
Kindly take appropriate action. 

Best regards,
Team Panchshil

Dear {!$Record.Owner:User.LastName},

You have been assigned an unregistered Channel Partner (CP) from a walk-in. Below are the details for your reference:

Details:
Firm Name: {!$Record.EYI_REC_Firm_Name__c}
Contact Number: {!$Record.EYI_Mobile__c}
RERA Registration Number: {!$Record.EYI_RERA_Number__c}
GST Number: {!$Record.EYI_GSTIN__c}
 PAN: {!$Record.EYI_PAN_No__c}

Kindly ensure that the CP is registered in the system at the earliest.

Best regards,
Team Panchshil

